or arrange such a submission through another person or organization.

Cloning, studying, changing, self-hosting, and connecting an instance for your
own use are permitted; seeking a listing or distributing an integration
through an AI Company is not. Sending individual mail data through an AI
client during permitted use is not a submission of the Software.

The Licensor retains the right to submit, publish, distribute, and separately
